        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased from Durlachers Bros, 142 New Bond Street, London, from the sale of the estate of Alfred Morrison on 1 December 1898. Described in the sale catalogue as: \"A Coverlit, with a geometrical design in blue, red and white - from Turkistan, 17th Century\"."@en ;
